          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngaphambi kwendlu wenza insika ezimbili, ubude bazo buzingalo ezingamatshumi amathathu lanhlanu, zileziduku phezulu ezizingalo ezinhlanu ubude. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wenza amaketane anjengezigqizo, wawafaka ezidukwini zensika; wenza ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " alikhulu, wawafaka emaketaneni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wazimisa insika ngaphambi kwethempeli, enye yaba ngakwesokunene, enye yaba ngakwesokhohlo; engakwesokunene wayibiza ngokuthi nguJakini, lengakwesokhohlo wayibiza ngokuthi nguBowasi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
